umental structure serves as a modern counterpart to the historical Arc de Triomphe, embodying the aspirations of contemporary France and the ideals of the European Union. The Grande Arche not only represents significant advancements in engineering and design but also stands as a symbol of a unified Europe at the cusp of the Digital Age, reflecting the socio-political context of the late 20th century.

